    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I'm sorry to hear that, it must have been tough for you. Have a good rest.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:10:13.020293+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "It must have been tough for you. I hope you're doing okay and taking good care of yourself.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:12:12.303714+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "It was tough for you. You sound like you have a really tough day ahead. How is your health? I hope you are taking care of yourself.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:14:35.187762+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, you're really tough. I hope your health is better than what you said.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:25:11.696474+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, I see. Well, thanks for your kind words! That really means a lot to me. It's always nice to hear compliments from friends. How are you feeling?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:31:19.419560+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks, Emily. That's really sweet of you to say. You know, I've always appreciated it when people appreciate my yoga practice.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:38:48.952017+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thanks, Olivia. That's really sweet of you to say, and it's nice to know that I have that kind of appreciation from people.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:43:45.362610+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Emily, your kind words are really appreciated! It's always nice to hear compliments from friends.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T01:51:13.333526+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Thank you, Olivia. That really means a lot to me! I'm glad to hear that!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T02:01:23.630232+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thank you, Emily! That really does mean a lot to me!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T02:30:04.679792+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, thank you so much!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T02:39:23.153522+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Thanks, I'm really glad you said that. I appreciate it. And you know what? I actually find out-of-work yoga more enjoyable than working out.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:01:09.931887+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's really interesting, I didn't know that! Do you enjoy out-of-work yoga or is it more like a hobby? What are your favorite things to do in your free time?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:02:12.911170+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "What is your favorite thing to do in your free time?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:11:04.353616+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I enjoy going for a run in the park. It's not very fast, so I don\u2019t burn much calories.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:31:13.844446+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Oh, really? That's a great idea. I love running as well. It helps me relax and clear my head after a long day. What about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:32:13.869579+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I love running too, I really do. It's a great way to get some exercise without getting too sweaty and burning too many calories.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:45:26.718881+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Running is definitely a great way to stay fit.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:46:24.549526+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh really? That's interesting, I didn't know that! Do you have any other hobbies or activities besides running and working out?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-10T03:59:08.422451+00:00"
    }
